                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ", voici les actualités de la semaine !\n\n1. HackNight CogLab : ce soir, rendez-vous pour notre habituelle soirée HackNight en ligne à partir de 18h30 "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "link",
                                "url": "https:\/\/www.meetup.com\/fr-FR\/CogLab\/events\/274744784\/"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "\n\n2. Demain matin à 9h, un panel de discussion sur Zoom par IEEE Brain Initiative sur le film documentaire ‘I Am Human’ :\n\n“IEEE Brain and the International Neuroethics Society are holding a 1-hour panel discussion on the award-winning documentary, ‘I Am Human’ at 3pm EST on December 2. The film explores the co-evolution of humans and technology by following three subjects with implantable brain interfaces and discussing the ethical implications of this technology on society. Register in advance to stream the film for free and to attend the online panel discussion.” "
                            },
